# Local secrets for `npm run dev` / `npm run preview`.
#
#   1. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored, never committed).
#   2. Fill in real values from each provider's dashboard.
#
# Non-secret settings (like APP_ENV) live in wrangler.jsonc "vars", not here.
# Staging/production secrets are set with: npx wrangler secret put <NAME> --env <staging|production>
# Full list and where each value comes from: docs/environments.md
#
# No secrets are needed yet (v0.1). Uncomment as each version adds them.

# --- v0.3 Database + auth ---
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://<user>:<password>@<host>/<db>?sslmode=require
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# CLERK_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET=whsec_...

# --- v0.4 Email capture ---
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=...

# --- v0.6 Payments (Razorpay TEST mode only) ---
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=...
# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=...
